1
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:03,900
海莉 快点
Haley, hurry up!

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,860
你快来不及了 我还做了巧克力煎饼
You don't have much time, and I made chocolate chip pancakes.

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:06,720
老妈 我不是12岁的小孩了
Mom, I'm not 12.

4
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:07,560
她那份给我
Dibs on hers.

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,740
宝贝 第一天上班激动吗
Honey, you excited about your first day?

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,260
你猜怎么着 我真的很激动
You know what? I really am.

7
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,680
上班这事儿吧
There's something about going to work

8
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:13,940
会让人觉得自己
that makes you feel like you're...

9
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,300
不知道 有价值吧
I don't know, worth something.

10
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,340
别介意哈 老妈
No offense, mom.

11
00:00:16,479 --> 00:00:18,860
听着 我想给你一些建议
Listen... I wanna give you some advice.

12
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,300
快点说 她要迟到了
Do it fast. She's gonna be late.

13
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:21,700
努力工作
Work hard.

14
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,220
专心致志
Keep your eye on the ball.

15
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,100
注意力集中
Stay focused.

16
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,880
永不...快看
Never... check it out!

17
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,060
小卡穿着工装
Cam in overalls!

18
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,180
米奇尔也给我发了一张
Mitchell sent me the same text!

19
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,080
为什么写着"瞧你干了什么好事"
Why "Look what you've done"?

20
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,700
因为小卡要来帮我
Oh, because Cam is helping me out

21
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:35,720
建一个棒球场
with that baseball field,

22
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,540
但米奇尔讨厌他打扮得跟农民似的
and Mitchell hates it when he gets all farmed up.

23
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,560
一提到农场和菲茨宝小丑 他就郁闷
His turn-offs are farm, Fizbo,

24
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,793
最郁闷的就是 农场宝
And, worst of all, farmbo.

25
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:45,144
你好呀 我的伙计
Howdy, life pardner!

26
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:50,460
我得走了 我不想第一天就迟...
Well, I gotta go. Don't wanna be late for my first--

27
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,640
天呐 你们怎么没告诉我时间
Oh, my god! Why didn't you guys tell me the time?!

28
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:57,840
你觉得怎么样 我们能把这改造成棒球场吗
So what do you think? Can we turn this into a baseball field?

29
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,060
当然 没有问题
Oh, yeah. No problem.

30
00:00:59,180 --> 00:00:59,940
以前在农场
You know, back on the farm,

31
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:02,680
我曾把一英亩的玉米地改造成了雪花形迷宫
I once turned an acre of corn into a snowflake-shaped maze.

32
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:04,660
要不是邻居比利·鲍勃·希恩伯格
It'd still be there if our neighbor Billy Bob Sheinberg

33
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,360
从他的撒药飞机上看下去
hadn't seen it from his crop duster

34
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:07,600
说像纳粹卐字标 迷宫肯定还保留着
and said it looked like a swastika.

35
00:01:09,020 --> 00:01:10,580
卢克的球队表现怎么样啊
So how good's Luke's team anyway?

36
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:12,360
你可以上Youtube搜
Well, you may have seen them on youtube

37
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:14,480
"男孩卡在头盔里了"
under "Boy stuck in batting helmet"

38
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:16,563
或者"投球手击中自己的头部"
or "Pitcher beans self."

39
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:19,380
不过其中一些孩子今年提早进入了青春期
But a few of them went through puberty early this year, so...

40
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:21,600
他们说是牛奶中的激素所致
They say it's because of hormones in our milk.

41
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:24,200
但不管是什么 确实挺管用的
But whatever it is, they really jacked up.

42
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:26,680
卢克和曼尼的球队要争取季后赛的最后一席
Luke and Manny's team tied for the final spot in the playoffs,

43
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:28,600
但由于没人料到如此
but since nobody was expecting it,

44
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:29,620
想订球场时已经来不及了
all the fields were booked.

45
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:31,860
对手球队想要抛硬币来一决胜负
The other team wanted to settle with a coin flip.

46
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:35,020
但我们说要石头剪刀布 于是就谈崩了
We said "Rock paper scissors." That's when talks broke down.

47
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:37,780
找不到球场该怎么办呢
So what do you do when you can't find a field?

48
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,460
自己建一个
You build one.

49
00:01:39,540 --> 00:01:41,140
于是我们笑到了最后
And we got the last laugh,

50
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:42,820
因为你猜我找到了什么
'cause guess what I found there?

51
00:01:42,820 --> 00:01:44,460
石头 剪刀 和布
Rocks, paper, and scissors.

52
00:01:45,741 --> 00:01:47,753
-我觉得本垒该设在这儿 -嗯
- I see home plate up here. - Mm-hmm.

53
00:01:47,753 --> 00:01:49,605
投手区在那儿
I see pitcher's mound in here,

54
00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:52,100
于是小男孩的梦想就此成真了
And I see little boys' dreams coming true everywhere.

55
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:53,700
我发现了一条死蛇
I found a dead snake!

56
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,860
真是"好"啊
It's perfect.

57
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:56,600
没死 没死
Not dead! Not dead!

58
00:01:56,671 --> 00:01:58,346
我要当上年度"好母亲"了
I'm gonna be mother of the year.

59
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:15,040
这里是我们的餐厅 我们吃饭的地方
And this is our dining room, where we eat.

60
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:17,760
这里是我们的厨房 也是吃饭的地方
And this is our kitchen, where we also eat.

61
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,920
你在跟谁说话
Who are you talking to?

62
00:02:19,020 --> 00:02:20,220
看起来像是你跟旅行团走散了
It looks like you lost your tour.

63
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,000
或是精神失常了
Or your mind.

64
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,480
我在跟宝宝讲话
The baby.

65
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:25,180
小短的女朋友达琳送给我的
Shorty's girlfriend Darlene send it to me.

66
00:02:25,180 --> 00:02:27,240
她说有利于产前母子关系的培养
She said it's for prenatal bonding.

67
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:29,860
我爱死了 我们参观了我们的家
I love it. We took a tour of the house.

68
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,720
还看了我所有的鞋子
We took a look at all my shoes.

69
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:33,600
来吧 杰 跟宝宝说说话
Come on, Jay. Say something to the baby.

70
00:02:33,700 --> 00:02:34,500
达琳是个傻瓜
Darlene's an idiot.

71
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:35,520
好吧 太棒了
Oh, yeah, beautiful.

72
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:37,100
你对宝宝说的第一句话就是
Your first words to our baby--

73
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:38,180
达琳是个傻瓜
"Darlene is an idiot."

74
00:02:38,180 --> 00:02:40,360
太愚蠢了 宝宝就隔着肚皮
This is stupid. The baby's only 2 inches away.

75
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,240
要跟他讲话 根本不用拿着麦克风吼
He doesn't need speakers blasting at him.

76
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,540
就像如今的餐厅
Like in restaurants nowadays

77
00:02:43,540 --> 00:02:45,020
你根本听不到自己在想什么
where you can't even hear yourself think.

78
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:46,920
反正你爱干嘛就干嘛 我操个什么心
Ah, you're gonna do whatever you want. Why do I bother?

79
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:51,240
习惯就好 有时候你就得让他发泄下
Get used to that. Sometimes you just gotta let him go.

80
00:02:51,300 --> 00:02:53,180
他会吃点冰冻果子露 睡一觉
Then he eats some sherbet and falls asleep.

81
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,080
我要用这玩意儿在场地上划线
Okay, I'll chalk the field with this bad boy.

82
00:02:57,140 --> 00:02:58,980
你划线时 我来搞定垒位
And while you're doing that, I will get the bases.

83
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,320
我们真是默契
We make such a good team.

84
00:03:00,420 --> 00:03:01,720
为什么你的朋友会有粉笔划线车
Why does your friend have a chalker?

85
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:03,560
他用来求婚的 那人是开飞机在空中作画的
Oh, he used it to propose to a skywriter.

86
00:03:03,849 --> 00:03:06,660
女士 女士 需要我帮忙吗
Oh, ma'am? Ma'am, do you need help with that?

87
00:03:06,660 --> 00:03:08,200
是的 拜托了
Oh, yes. Please.

88
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:09,080
这是你的房子吗
Is this your house?

89
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:11,160
我要搬去和我的儿子一起住
I'm moving in with my son.

90
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:12,380
他很有钱
He's rich.

91
00:03:12,380 --> 00:03:14,408
马桶边都装了电话
Phone by the toilet rich.

92
00:03:14,408 --> 00:03:16,109
那你在这儿住很久了吗
All right, so have you lived here a long time?

93
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:19,380
我是62年搬过来 想做演员的
I moved here in '62 to be an actress.

94
00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:22,120
我在《洛克福档案》一剧中有句台词
I had one line in a "Rockford files."

95
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,060
他从后门溜走了
"He went out the back.,"

96
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:26,420
谁从后门溜走了
Who went out the back?

97
00:03:26,540 --> 00:03:27,260
原来那是你演的啊
That was you.

98
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:30,440
这个给你弄好了
Well, you're all set here.

99
00:03:30,700 --> 00:03:32,740
你们对这房子有兴趣吗
You're not interested in the place, are you?

100
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:34,551
-没有 谢谢 -有 我们有兴趣
- Oh, no, thank you. - Yes--yes, we are.

101
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,940
是的是的 我们有兴趣
Yes. Yes, we are.

102
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,600
-过来吧 -好的
- Come on. - Okay.

103
00:03:41,191 --> 00:03:42,820
眼睛不能闭上
You gotta keep your eyes open.

104
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:45,180
球快打中脸了 闭眼是正常反应啊
It's not natural when a ball is hurtling at your face.

105
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:46,520
你能往球棒中间握一点吗[激动地说不出话]
Will you choke up a little?

106
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,200
那得等到奏国歌的时候
Probably when they play the national anthem.

107
00:03:48,500 --> 00:03:50,080
不 我是说 你的手往上握一点
No, move your hands up the bat.

108
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:53,040
得等到奏国歌的时候
"When they play the national anthem."

109
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,800
我有着完美的纪录
I had a perfect record--

110
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,880
22场比赛 我一局都没上
22 games, and I hadn't played a single inning.

111
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,040
然后麦考伊双胞胎的奶奶死了
Then the Mccoy twins' grandma dies,

112
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:00,681
我就被突然叫上右外场
and suddenly I'm starting at right field.

113
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:03,720
那到底什么意思啊 跟舞台右侧一样吗
What does that even mean? Is it the same as stage right?

114
00:04:04,780 --> 00:04:06,860
准备好了吗 慢慢来 放轻松
All right, ready? Nice and easy.

115
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:10,020
我都还没扔呢
I haven't even thrown it yet.

116
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:12,060
那是你的错 我做了我该做的事
Then it's your fault. I'm doing my part.

117
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:13,920
算了吧 我们得采取新措施
Forget it. We need to do something different.

118
00:04:15,180 --> 00:04:16,400
你的击球姿势要改一改
Let's change your stance.

119
00:04:16,780 --> 00:04:18,040
试着往前倾一点
Try leaning in.

120
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:18,900
再倾斜一点
Further.

121
00:04:19,660 --> 00:04:22,380
现在闭上眼睛
Now close your eyes.

122
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:26,400
好极了 你可以每次都这样吗
Ah! Perfect! You think you can do that every time?

123
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:28,040
哪样 故意挨打吗
What, get hit on purpose?

124
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:29,960
你想上垒成为英雄就得这样
If you wanna get on base and be a hero.

125
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:32,000
有些人生而伟大
Some men are born into greatness.

126
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,040
有些人活该丢脸
Others have it chucked at their face.

127
00:04:35,340 --> 00:04:35,780
真棒
Yes!

128
00:04:37,340 --> 00:04:38,940
布鲁克太太 非常感谢
Okay, Mrs. Brooks, thank you very much.

129
00:04:39,020 --> 00:04:40,240
我们会尽快跟你联系的
We'll be in touch very soon.

130
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,440
再说一次
Say it one more time.

131
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:42,462
他从后门溜走了
He went out the back.

132
00:04:42,462 --> 00:04:45,408
-我喜欢 大爱啊 -精彩 精彩
- Oh, love it! Love it! - Brava! Brava!

133
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:46,340
再见
Bye-bye!

134
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,500
菲尔 你觉得怎么样
What do you think, Phil?

135
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:50,140
不得不承认 真是遇着个大便宜
Well, I have to admit, it's a steal.

136
00:04:51,140 --> 00:04:52,420
没错啊 我就说嘛
Yes! Yes! I told you!

137
00:04:52,420 --> 00:04:54,800
你还说吉尔·索普靠炒房赚了一大笔钱
And you said Gil Thorpe makes a killing flipping houses.

138
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,280
可不 他一直拿这件事大吹特吹
Yeah, he brags about it all the time.

139
00:04:56,420 --> 00:04:57,340
他每做成一笔买卖
Every time he makes a sale,

140
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:58,420
都说自己是"大炒家"
he calls himself "Flipper"

141
00:04:58,420 --> 00:05:01,420
一边走来走去一边发海豚音 像这样...
And walks around making this dolphin sound. Like...

142
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:04,300
他是怎么发出来的 我真讨厌他
How does he do it? I hate him so much.

143
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:06,320
要是我们四个一起合伙
Okay, look, if the four of us go in on this together,

144
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,460
就能把风险降到最低
We can minimize the risk.

145
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,480
或者我们谁都别掺和
Or if none of us do it,

146
00:05:08,540 --> 00:05:09,840
就能完全避免风险
we can eliminate the risk altogether

147
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:11,740
因为你们都对翻新旧房投资一无所知
because none of you know anything about flipping houses.

148
00:05:11,751 --> 00:05:13,160
我们都已经想好了
Okay, well, we already have it figured out.

149
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,320
由我来担任设计师
I'm gonna be the designer...

150
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:15,920
因为我熟知颜色和图形
Because I know about colors and shapes.

151
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,700
没错 莉莉也知道
Yeah, so does Lily.

152
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:19,100
我来担任承建人
I'm gonna be the contractor.

153
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:21,800
那我来当宇航员 真好玩 菲尔 你来
And I'm gonna be the astronaut. Oh, this is fun. Phil, you go.

154
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:22,940
米奇尔 我说正经的
Mitchell, I am serious.

155
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,860
我给自己家很多工程当过监工
I have overseen lots of projects in our home.

156
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,880
我家浴室改造就是我监工的
I oversaw the remodel of our bathroom.

157
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:28,100
没超预算 对不对 菲尔
Under budget. Right, Phil?

158
00:05:28,300 --> 00:05:29,880
没错 我有点儿失望没装
Yeah. I was a little disappointed we didn't go for

159
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:31,400
有自动冲屁屁功能的马桶 其它的...
the butt-washing toilet, but otherwise...

160
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:32,740
你自己洗屁股又不用花钱
You can wash your own butt for free.

161
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,060
那不一样 好吗
Well, that's not the same, is it?

162
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:35,320
我很高兴谈这个
This is all fun to talk about.

163
00:05:35,340 --> 00:05:37,440
真的 但是我想你们还是没弄明白
It is, but I don't think that you understand

164
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,910
炒房意味着什么 而且...
what--what this could really entail. And--

165
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:41,320
好了 米奇尔说"不" 我们就死心吧
Okay, there it is. Mitchell just said "No," So we're done.

166
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:42,120
意外吗 不意外
Surprise, surprise.

167
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:44,200
我们回家再谈 好吗
Listen, we'll talk about this at home, okay?

168
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:46,940
别灰心
Don't give up.

169
00:05:47,980 --> 00:05:49,860
菲尔 你也同意这是个好主意吧
Phil, you think it's a good idea, right?

170
00:05:50,220 --> 00:05:50,600
绝对的
Totally.

171
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:53,380
对 而且你也觉得我们能应付得来 对吧
Yes. And you know we can handle it, right?

172
00:05:53,500 --> 00:05:54,980
我认为你们什么都能应付
I think you guys can handle anything.

173
00:05:56,271 --> 00:05:57,800
那你过去跟他谈谈 你可是专业人士
And you go talk to him. You're a professional.

174
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,580
他会尊重你的意见
He respects you.

175
00:05:58,660 --> 00:06:00,920
好吧 让我们单聊 我和他好好谈谈
Okay. Give us some space. I'll go talk him into it.

176
00:06:00,980 --> 00:06:01,820
-好的 -好吗
- All right. - All right?

177
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,740
-好的 -好
- Okay. - Okay.

178
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:04,680
听着
Listen...

179
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,560
我们绝对不能让他们干这件事
there's no way we're letting them do this.

180
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,420
我就说嘛 是不是
I know, right?

181
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:09,260
他们那两把刷子根本搞不定
They are not equipped to take this on.

182
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:10,600
我们所有的积蓄都会随我家那无趣的
We might as well flush all our savings

183
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,900
旧马桶一冲而逝的
down my boring old toilet.

184
00:06:11,900 --> 00:06:13,440
你真的很纠结马桶的事啊
Oh, you are really bitter about that.

185
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:16,240
当时我就这要求 别把你的太阳镜坐碎了
It's the one thing I asked for. Don't sit on your sunglasses.

186
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,320
很遗憾 伙计们
Sorry, guys.

187
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:21,640
哎呀 说得再明白一点
Whoops. Just to be clear, though.

188
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:23,940
无论如何 我们都不能让他们做这件事
Under no circumstances are we letting them do this?

189
00:06:23,940 --> 00:06:25,300
我完全同意
I am totally with you.

190
00:06:25,380 --> 00:06:27,640
你待在这边 我去传达坏消息
Okay, you stay here. I'll go break the bad news.

191
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,620
对不起 伙计们 没说动他
Sorry, guys. Not gonna happen.

192
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:32,100
-可是 要不我... -放弃吧
- Yeah, well, maybe if-- - I would drop it.

193
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:33,760
不值得为这个吵架 来 克莱尔
It's not worth the fight. Come on, Claire.

194
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:36,020
我们走的越快 伤的越轻
The faster we leave, the less it's gonna hurt.

195
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,460
上车
Hop in. Yep.

196
00:06:42,180 --> 00:06:43,740
为什么非得这样呢
Why does it have to be like this?

197
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:45,720
不知道呀 你弟弟 系上安全带没 好
I don't know. He's your brother. Buckled up? Good.

198
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:48,520
别 别走 我明白你的阴招了
No! No! No, no, I see what you're doing!

199
00:06:49,076 --> 00:06:51,040
他也不赞成
He doesn't want this either!

200
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:51,820
-放点儿音乐 -好的
- Little radio? - Sure.

201
00:06:53,772 --> 00:06:56,122
菲尔 克莱尔
Phil! Claire!

202
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:56,820
拜托
Come on!

203
00:07:05,220 --> 00:07:06,240
真可惜
It's such a shame

204
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:08,860
因为我知道我们一定会把那房子炒成功的
because I know we would do a great job on that house.

205
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:11,480
-当然 -吉尔·索普能做我就能做 对吧
- Totally. - If Gil Thorpe can do it, I can do it, right?

206
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:11,972
拜托
Please!

207
00:07:11,980 --> 00:07:15,540
拜托 吉尔·索普有几十年的经验
Please. Gil Thorpe has decades of experience

208
00:07:15,540 --> 00:07:16,700
以及一向靠谱的直觉
and infallible instincts.

209
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:19,140
虽说人人都希望不是这样子的
As much as we'd all like to believe otherwise,

210
00:07:19,300 --> 00:07:20,880
但我娶的可不是吉尔·索普
I did not marry Gil Thorpe.

211
00:07:21,900 --> 00:07:23,400
你能想象吗
Can you imagine that?

212
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,540
老天爷 那我们得卖出去老多房子了
God, we'd sell a lot of houses.

213
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,440
太好了
Oh! Great.

214
00:07:30,180 --> 00:07:31,680
-是米奇尔 -你知道吗 克莱尔
- Mitchell. - Oh, you know what, Claire?

215
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:33,360
你得冷静下 不然会把事情搞得更糟
You gotta cool down or you're just gonna make this worse.

216
00:07:33,420 --> 00:07:34,320
你还是去买咖啡吧
Why don't you go get the coffees?

217
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:35,100
我和他交涉
And I'll deal with him.

218
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:36,860
好吧 你要和他说什么
Well, okay, what are you gonna say to him?

219
00:07:36,860 --> 00:07:38,400
我要和他来一场男人间的对话
I'm just gonna talk to him man-to-man.

220
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:39,440
好吧
Right.

221
00:07:39,780 --> 00:07:40,100
好
Okay.

222
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:42,280
喂
Hello?

223
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:44,920
克莱尔 菲尔也不愿意买那栋房子
Claire, Phil doesn't want the house either, all right?

224
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,540
他就是让我替他受过 他是个骗子
He's letting me take the fall. He's a liar.

225
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,940
而且是个聪明的骗子
And a clever one.

226
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:50,540
你以为你能瞒她多久
Ugh! How long do you think you can keep this from her?

227
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:52,220
到最后我还是会和她说的
All right? I'm gonna talk to her eventually.

228
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,680
那既然我们一直互吐心声
Well, as long as we're swapping stories,

229
00:07:53,700 --> 00:07:54,500
或许我该跟小卡说说
Maybe I'll tell Cam

230
00:07:54,500 --> 00:07:56,740
他给你织的那件毛衣到底是什么下场
What happened to the sweater he knit for you.

231
00:07:59,989 --> 00:08:00,680
不行
I can't.

232
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,180
不行 受不了了
I can't! I can't!

233
00:08:02,340 --> 00:08:05,000
我受不了了 我得把这个傻玩意儿扔了
I can't do it! I can't take this stupid thing anymore!

234
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:09,580
它是被人从车里偷走的 你明白没
It was stolen out of the car. Do you understand me?

235
00:08:09,700 --> 00:08:10,360
懂了
Got it.

236
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:13,700
真卑鄙
That is low.

237
00:08:14,180 --> 00:08:15,300
我知道 别生我气
I know. Don't be mad at me.

238
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:17,360
所以说 我劝你别再打了
That said, I suggest you lose this number.

239
00:08:18,900 --> 00:08:20,460
我并不为自己的行为感到骄傲
I'm not proud of what I did,

240
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:22,780
但我不是那种摧毁别人梦想的人
but I'm not comfortable squashing people's dreams.

241
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:23,880
我可是个啦啦队长
I am a cheerleader.

242
00:08:23,940 --> 00:08:25,600
我习惯于在叠罗汉最高处大喊
I'm the guy on top of the pyramid shouting,

243
00:08:25,780 --> 00:08:26,840
朝着梦想 加油
"Go, dreams, go!"

244
00:08:27,660 --> 00:08:28,540
知道什么话不能加油吗
You know what's not a cheer?

245
00:08:28,780 --> 00:08:30,160
二 四 六 八
"Two, four, six, eight,

246
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,500
你会搞砸它
you are going to fail at this

247
00:08:31,500 --> 00:08:33,480
害我们卖铁又砸锅 克莱尔
and lose everything we've worked for, Claire!

248
00:08:35,164 --> 00:08:37,176
*别出声 小宝贝*
*Hush, little baby,*

249
00:08:37,186 --> 00:08:39,024
*你什么都不用说*
*don't say a word.*

250
00:08:39,034 --> 00:08:42,371
*爸爸会给你买只知更鸟*
*Papa's going to buy you a mockingbird.*

251
00:08:42,371 --> 00:08:46,200
*要是那只知更鸟不唱歌*
*And if that mockingbird won't sing,*

252
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:49,978
*爸爸就给你买只大钻戒*
*papa's gonna buy you a diamond ring.*

253
00:08:49,978 --> 00:08:51,600
爸爸愿意出钱买十只钻戒
Papa'd buy ten diamond rings

254
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,700
让那只呱噪的知更鸟闭上嘴
to get that mockingbird to shut the hell up.

255
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:56,760
但我不会跟歌洛莉亚说她唱歌难听
But I wasn't gonna tell Gloria she was a terrible singer.

256
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:59,120
那简直是自掘坟墓
That's just taking a bath with a toaster.

257
00:08:59,980 --> 00:09:00,880
但是 一想到
Still, the thought of

258
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:03,140
我可怜的小宝贝像个人质一样被困在里面
that poor little thing stuck in there like a hostage,

259
00:09:03,340 --> 00:09:05,940
被迫全天候听着那样的噪音
listening to that racket days on end...

260
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:08,000
让我于心何忍
I just couldn't take it.

261
00:09:08,146 --> 00:09:12,102
*要是那只公山羊不使劲*
*And if that billy goat won't push,*

262
00:09:12,102 --> 00:09:15,390
*爸爸会给你...*
*papa's gonna get every le--*

263
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,940
我来告诉你爸爸会怎么样
I'll tell you what papa's gonna do.

264
00:09:16,980 --> 00:09:18,340
他会接过这只麦克风
He's gonna take a turn on that mic.

265
00:09:18,500 --> 00:09:20,120
-真的吗 -是的 我一直在想
- Oh! Really? - Yeah, I've been thinking,

266
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:22,020
这是建立感情的机会 我也该试试
if it's a chance to bond, I should take it.

267
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,920
杰 太好了
Ay, Jay, that's great.

268
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:25,920
我觉得宝宝不应该
I think that the sound of my voice

269
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:28,220
只听到我一个人的声音
shouldn't be the only thing that the baby should hear.

270
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:28,780
完全同意
Same page.

271
00:09:29,374 --> 00:09:31,000
呼叫 呼叫 我是老杰
Breaker, breaker, big Jay.

272
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,300
宝宝 你在什么方位 完毕
Baby, what's your 20? Over.

273
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:33,125
好萌啊你
Ay, that's so cute.

274
00:09:33,125 --> 00:09:35,860
听起来像电影《警察与卡车强盗》中的对话
You sound like Smokey and the Bandito.

275
00:09:35,860 --> 00:09:36,560
继续继续
Go on. Go on.

276
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:38,680
你好 孩子 我是你爸杰·普里契特
Hi, kid. This is your dad Jay Pritchett.

277
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:40,803
我们都迫不及待想见到你
Uh, we're all pretty excited to meet you.

278
00:09:40,940 --> 00:09:41,640
就给你提个醒
Just a heads-up--

279
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:43,980
我可能比你想象的要老一点
I might be a few years older than you're expecting.

280
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:46,420
但好的方面是 我们的日子过得很滋润
But on the plus side, we're very comfortable.

281
00:09:47,582 --> 00:09:49,166
什么 没反应吗
What's that? Nothin'?

282
00:09:49,634 --> 00:09:50,599
难逗乐的宝宝
Tough womb.

283
00:09:50,599 --> 00:09:51,996
你在里面干什么呢 睡觉吗
What are you doing in there? You sleepin'?

284
00:09:52,820 --> 00:09:55,004
*你在睡觉吗*
*Are you sleeping?*

285
00:09:55,004 --> 00:09:56,100
-停停停 -*你在...*
- Ah! Ah! Ah! - *Are you--*

286
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:59,100
爸爸还没说完呢
Ah! Still daddy's turn.

287
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:05,840
该死 该死的石头
Dumb--dumb rock!

288
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:11,187
-你是哭了吗 -没有
- Are you cryin'? - No.

289
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,300
没有 我只是弄不走这块石头
No. I just can't get this rock to budge.

290
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:15,380
从《红粉联盟》里我们学到了什么
Okay, what did we learn from "A League of Their Own"?

291
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,940
棒球场上不能掉眼泪
No crying in baseball.

292
00:10:17,060 --> 00:10:18,760
错 我们知道了麦当娜演技很差
No. That Madonna's a lousy actress,

293
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:19,420
你也一样
and so are you.

294
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,520
你到底怎么了
What's really going on?

295
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:21,880
好吧
Okay.

296
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:25,280
你知道吗 几个月以来
You know, over the last couple of months,

297
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:28,020
我申请了五份工作
I've applied for, like, five different jobs.

298
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,420
-我还真不知道 -我跟谁也没说
- I didn't know that. - No. I didn't tell anyone,

299
00:10:30,420 --> 00:10:33,090
因为没一家愿意要我的 小卡
Because I didn't get them, Cam.

300
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:36,160
我上过大学的 你知道吗
I went to college, you know?

301
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:40,240
我只是想赚钱供孩子们上学
And... I just wanna be able to contribute to my kids' education.

302
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,900
我还想给我老公买件礼物
And I wanna be able to buy my husband a present...

303
00:10:42,900 --> 00:10:44,120
用我自己的钱买
with my own money.

304
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,060
你不用说我也明白
Hey, you're preaching to the choir director.

305
00:10:46,060 --> 00:10:48,100
这正是我成为唱诗班指导的原因
It's actually why I became a choir director.

306
00:10:48,100 --> 00:10:52,300
你在公立学校兼职教书是为了赚钱吗
You became a part-time teacher in a public school for money?

307
00:10:52,620 --> 00:10:53,760
我比你挣得多
I make more than you do.

308
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:56,420
我是说 不算停车费的话 但是
I mean, before parking. But...

309
00:10:56,420 --> 00:10:59,920
我很抱歉米奇尔扼杀了我们的炒房梦
Look, I'm sorry Mitchell killed our house dream.

310
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,660
尤其是现在我知道你挣钱是为了
You know, now especially that I know you wanted to use the money

311
00:11:02,660 --> 00:11:03,820
去做那么高尚的事
for such noble reasons.

312
00:11:04,180 --> 00:11:04,700
是啊
Yeah.

313
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:07,500
另外...
And also...

314
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:08,860
有一双我超想买的靴子
there was this pair of boots.

315
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,580
谁没有想买的靴子啊
There's always a pair of boots.

316
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:19,860
米奇尔 你知道我意识到什么了吗
Mitchell, do you know what I've realized?

317
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,760
有些事还是不说为妙吗
That some thoughts are better left unexpressed?

318
00:11:21,980 --> 00:11:23,560
不 我意识到在这段感情中
No. That in this relationship,

319
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:25,440
我是油门 而你是刹车
I'm the gas pedal, and you're the brakes.

320
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:26,600
慢着 慢着慢着
Okay, wait. Wait. Wait. Wait. Wait.

321
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,420
上星期你还说
Last week, you said that

322
00:11:27,420 --> 00:11:28,860
你是画儿我是框呢
you were the painting and I was the frame.

323
00:11:29,100 --> 00:11:30,200
那是把我们比喻成艺术品
That's if we were artwork.

324
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:31,600
现在我把我们比喻成一辆车
This is if we were a car.

325
00:11:31,860 --> 00:11:33,500
要是比喻成马的话 我知道你是哪部分
I know what part you'd be if we were a horse.

326
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:34,400
-你说什么 -什么
- Excuse me? - Hmm?

327
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:37,220
我和克莱尔给你带来一个好机会
Claire and I bring you this great opportunity,

328
00:11:37,220 --> 00:11:38,520
你却无情地拒绝了
And you stop it cold.

329
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,880
你不是刹车是什么
I guess that's what brakes do.

330
00:11:40,180 --> 00:11:41,260
你知道刹车还有什么作用吗
You know what brakes also do?

331
00:11:41,380 --> 00:11:42,760
能避免你冲下悬崖
They keep you from driving off cliffs.

332
00:11:42,940 --> 00:11:45,520
也许根本就不存在悬崖 也许是个上坡
Maybe they're not cliffs. Maybe they're ramps,

333
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:47,560
能把我们带向崭新的美好未来
ready to launch us into new, exciting vistas.

334
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:49,920
不只我一人反对这投资房子的事
I am not the only one against this whole house thing.

335
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:50,760
菲尔也不同意
Phil doesn't want it either.

336
00:11:50,900 --> 00:11:51,700
你一直这么说
You keep saying that,

337
00:11:51,700 --> 00:11:53,520
但我非常 非常怀疑
but I find that very, very hard to believe.

338
00:11:53,820 --> 00:11:54,860
菲尔总是支持克莱尔
Phil supports Claire.

339
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:56,500
他是个充满正能量的啦啦队长
Phil is a cheerleader.

340
00:11:56,920 --> 00:11:58,360
你怎么就不能学学菲尔呢
Why can't you be more like phil?

341
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,280
就在那时我猛然想到
And then it hit me.

342
00:12:01,300 --> 00:12:03,080
我可以学学菲尔
I could be exactly like Phil.

343
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:04,920
我可以假装支持他们
I could pretend to be on board,

344
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:07,000
让啦啦队长来背黑锅
forcing the cheerleader to be the bad guy.

345
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,520
我知道这么做挺卑鄙
I know it's underhanded,

346
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,480
但爷就是这么卑鄙
but that's the way I throw.

347
00:12:12,954 --> 00:12:14,380
-米奇尔 -你猜怎么着
- Mitchell? - You--you know what?

348
00:12:14,380 --> 00:12:15,120
我被你说服了
You've convinced me.

349
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:17,520
如果你和克莱尔 还有尤其是菲尔
If--if you and Claire and especially Phil

350
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:19,160
想这么干 那我支持你们
are into this, then I'm on board.

351
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:21,960
-什么 真的吗 -对 全力支持
- What? Seriously?! - Yes! 100%.

352
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:24,140
实际上 你何不这就打给克莱尔和菲尔
In fact, why don't you call Claire and Phil

353
00:12:24,140 --> 00:12:24,860
告诉他们这个好消息
right now and tell them?

354
00:12:24,860 --> 00:12:26,700
好 通往未来的上坡打动你了对吗
Okay. It was the ramp thing, wasn't it?

355
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:27,840
我也真心觉得这句很有感染力
You know, I felt really good about it.

356
00:12:29,580 --> 00:12:29,980
什么
What?

357
00:12:30,260 --> 00:12:32,580
真的吗 太好了
Are you serious? That's fantastic!

358
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:34,380
我得告诉菲尔 马上给你打回去
Oh! I gotta tell Phil. I'll call you right back.

359
00:12:34,416 --> 00:12:35,925
怎么 什么事
What's--what's up?

360
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,620
米奇尔改主意了
Mitchell changed his mind.

361
00:12:37,620 --> 00:12:39,585
他愿意加入 我们要投资房地产咯
He's all for it. We're flipping a house!

362
00:12:39,585 --> 00:12:41,360
-好耶 -好耶
- Yeah. - Yeah!

363
00:12:45,100 --> 00:12:46,340
喂 你好啊 菲尔
Well, hello, Phil.

364
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,020
接到你的电话真是倍感荣幸啊
To what do I owe this pleasure?

365
00:12:48,540 --> 00:12:49,220
少装蒜了
Cut the crap.

366
00:12:49,220 --> 00:12:51,432
想扮无辜吗 那可是我的专长
You wanna play chicken? Chicken's my middle name.

367
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:53,140
听不懂你在说什么
I don't know what you're talking about.

368
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:56,040
我只是在支持我的伴侣及姐姐
I'm just being supportive of my partner and my sister,

369
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,620
我非常爱他们两个
both of whom I love very much.

370
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,080
做这种缺德事你晚上睡得着吗
How do you sleep at night?

371
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:01,700
睡得可香了 我知道你会主持大义的
Soundly, knowing you'll do the right thing.

372
00:13:02,060 --> 00:13:03,300
菲尔 怎么样
So how about it, Phil?

373
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:06,240
你能力挽狂澜吗 刹车已经不灵了
You gonna stop this train? 'cause these brakes are out.

374
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:09,800
哦对了 我劝你别再打了
Oh. And I suggest you lose this number.

375
00:13:11,100 --> 00:13:11,280
米奇尔
Mitchell?

376
00:13:12,260 --> 00:13:12,740
米奇尔
Mitchell?!

377
00:13:15,540 --> 00:13:17,000
是的 老子怒了
Yeah, I was pretty ticked off

378
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,540
米奇尔居然在我的计上耍计
that Mitchell double-crossed my double-cross.

379
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:19,960
他现在不接我电话
And then he stopped taking my calls,

380
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:22,680
所以我谨慎地遣词造句 发给他如下短信
And so I sent him the following carefully worded text...

381
00:13:24,312 --> 00:13:25,397
你坏透了
"U suck."

382
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:28,980
我知道菲尔受了伤
I could tell Phil felt pretty hurt

383
00:13:28,980 --> 00:13:31,620
心里憋屈 所以我给了如下回复
and betrayed, so I responded.

384
00:13:31,620 --> 00:13:33,398
你打算如何加油杀出一条血路 啦啦队长
"How r u gonna cheerlead your way out of this one, buffy?"

385
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:36,560
我们都知道买房子这事是场灾难
"We both know this house thing is a disaster."

386
00:13:37,020 --> 00:13:38,980
那你就出声 否则我来
"Then say something, or I will.

387
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:41,040
我不介意你向小卡揭发...
I don't care if you tell Cam..."

388
00:13:41,100 --> 00:13:42,560
我把那件丑陋的毛衣扔了
"I threw out that hideous sweater?!"

389
00:13:43,260 --> 00:13:45,720
我用数月织了那件"丑陋"的毛衣
I spent months knitting that hideous sweater.

390
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:47,570
-是吧 -我们怎么能看到短信
- Yeah. - W--how are we seeing this?

391
00:13:47,580 --> 00:13:49,300
他俩昨天就开始用群短信了
They're using the group text from yesterday.

392
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:51,340
他们根本不知道我会看到
They have no idea these are even coming to me.

393
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:52,000
好吧
Okay.

394
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,540
又来一条
Oh. Here's another one.

395
00:13:53,940 --> 00:13:56,380
我们得想办法神不知鬼不觉地
"We need to shut this house thing down

396
00:13:56,380 --> 00:13:58,280
让买房这事儿泡汤
Without them knowing it's us"?!

397
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,340
有种啊你们
Oh! Well...

398
00:14:00,664 --> 00:14:03,364
太迟了
"2 late."

399
00:14:06,256 --> 00:14:08,532
完了 这下糟了
No, that--that's bad.

400
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:15,860
克莱尔 我错了
Claire, I am so sorry.

401
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:18,260
我不应该对你隐瞒的 但是我...
I know I should've been more honest with you, but I--

402
00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:18,600
不 菲尔
No, Phil.

403
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:20,080
知道最让我伤心的是什么
You know what really kills me?

404
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:23,100
你信什么也不信我
Is you didn't believe in me, and you believe in everything!

405
00:14:23,780 --> 00:14:26,640
我就知道那件毛衣不是被人偷了
You know, I knew that sweater wasn't stolen.

406
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:29,280
亏我特地选了蓝色毛线来衬你的蓝眼睛
And here I pick blue yarn to match your eyes,

407
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:31,529
我应该选黑色的来搭你的心
but I should've picked black to match your heart.

408
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:33,240
不过你穿黑色真心帅 你妹的
Although you look amazing in black. Damn you.

409
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:36,020
我们走
Come on.

410
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:40,520
17人死亡 数千居民没有供电
"...Leaving 17 dead and thousands without power."

411
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:42,120
杰 拜托
Ay, Jay, please!

412
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:45,240
让宝宝听这么恐怖的东西不好
It's bad that the baby listens to such terrible things.

413
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,380
他听过更恐怖的
He's heard worse.

414
00:14:46,380 --> 00:14:48,740
杰 你知道哪有好的一小时即取干洗店吗
Jay, do you know a good 1-hour dry cleaner?

415
00:14:48,740 --> 00:14:50,460
不是"十点前收
And I don't mean the "Must be in by 10:00,

416
00:14:50,460 --> 00:14:52,560
仅工作日营业 且凭优惠券使用"那种
only on weekdays, you need a coupon" Kind.

417
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:53,920
就是实打实的一小时
I mean a hard 1-hour.

418
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:55,920
这段对话感觉有实打实的一小时
This conversation feels like a hard one hour.

419
00:14:56,220 --> 00:14:58,080
你去干洗店干嘛 这挺干净的啊
And what do you need it cleaned for? It's spotless.

420
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,960
被罗本的三明治溅上芥末酱了
There's mustard here from Reuben's reuben.

421
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:01,060
让个自恋狂负责零食日
That's what happens when

422
00:15:01,060 --> 00:15:02,880
就会落得这个下场
you put a narcissist in charge of snack day.

423
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:04,380
好啦 又该我了
Okay, it's my turn again.

424
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:07,040
宝贝 又到妈妈咯
Baby, it's your mother again.

425
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:07,849
-我... -歌洛莉亚
- I'm-- - Gloria?

426
00:15:07,860 --> 00:15:08,940
何不让他休息片刻
Why don't we give him a break?

427
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,260
也许他需要休息一下
He probably needs a minute

428
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:11,980
毕竟他刚听了致命龙卷风的故事
because he just learned about a deadly tornado.

429
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:13,820
行 但别一直用"他"称呼宝宝
Okay, stop calling him a he.

430
00:15:14,060 --> 00:15:16,400
如果是个女孩儿呢 你会让她生气的
What if he's a she, and you're making her upset?

431
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:18,440
我跟你说过 这不为了方便点嘛
I told you. That's just the shorthand I'm using.

432
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:19,216
-别总挑我刺儿啦 -是吗
- Don't jump down my throat every time I'm - Ay, yes,

433
00:15:19,216 --> 00:15:21,760
-那是因为你总是... -你们干嘛呢
- because you always - What are you doing?

434
00:15:21,760 --> 00:15:23,300
你们想让肚子里的宝宝
Do you really want your unborn baby

435
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:24,740
听见你们的争吵吗
to hear you fighting like this?

436
00:15:25,180 --> 00:15:26,360
研究表明置胎儿
Studies show it's unhealthy

437
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,820
于紧张氛围下 会有害其健康
For a fetus to be exposed to a stressful environment.

438
00:15:29,020 --> 00:15:30,760
刚13岁谈什么研究 去看漫画书去
Studies? You're 13. Read a comic book.

439
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:32,720
你那比赛几点开始
What time does your game start?

440
00:15:32,800 --> 00:15:34,440
我得三点钟到 先做"打"球练习
I have to be there at 3:00 for hitting practice.

441
00:15:34,760 --> 00:15:35,780
那叫击球练习
Batting practice.

442
00:15:35,980 --> 00:15:36,640
打中的是我
Not for me.

443
00:15:37,460 --> 00:15:39,380
杰 我不想让宝宝认为
Jay, I don't want our baby to think

444
00:15:39,380 --> 00:15:42,231
他将出生在一个不和睦的家庭
that it's coming into an unhappy home.

445
00:15:42,300 --> 00:15:45,980
我们得保证 永远不会再在他面前吵架了
Let's promise that we're never ever going to fight in front of him.

446
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,500
不在宝宝面前吵架
No fighting in front of the baby.

447
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:48,720
对 很好
Okay, good.

448
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:52,680
*一闪一闪*
*Twinkle, twinkle*

449
00:15:52,690 --> 00:15:54,940
*小羊羔啊*
*Little lamb*

450
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:57,600
歌洛莉亚 别再唱了
Gloria, stop it! Stop it. No more singing.

451
00:15:58,220 --> 00:15:58,660
为什么
Why?

452
00:15:59,220 --> 00:16:00,040
你唱得太烂了
Because you stink.

453
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,720
你真的不会唱歌
You're a terrible singer.

454
00:16:03,780 --> 00:16:04,980
来 我们该吃午饭了
Come on. Let's get some lunch.

455
00:16:07,430 --> 00:16:09,333
你胆敢说我...
How dare do you say that I am...

456
00:16:09,333 --> 00:16:11,020
我了解 别这样
I know! Ay, no, no, no.

457
00:16:11,020 --> 00:16:12,840
刚说好的 不在宝宝面前吵架
No fighting in front of the baby. We just made a deal.

458
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:13,760
但那不公平
Yeah, but that's not fair

459
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:15,640
我一直都跟宝宝在一起
because I am always in front of the baby!

460
00:16:15,820 --> 00:16:18,240
歌洛莉亚 作为一个女人你接近完美
Gloria, you're as close to perfect as woman gets.

461
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,980
有点小瑕疵也没什么嘛
Nothing wrong with one tiny, little flaw.

462
00:16:20,460 --> 00:16:22,080
就是你唱歌的时候
Yours is when you start to sing,

463
00:16:22,740 --> 00:16:24,560
声音有如吸尘器被什么东西卡住了
is sounds like something got stuck in the vacuum cleaner.

464
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:25,258
那是你...
That's--you're just--

465
00:16:25,267 --> 00:16:26,479
别这样
No, no, no.

466
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:31,280
那只是你不懂欣赏罢了 杰
That is just your stupid, stupid opinion, Jay.

467
00:16:32,020 --> 00:16:33,740
我现在很生气
But I am very angry at you,

468
00:16:33,750 --> 00:16:35,460
我会去列个单
and I am gonna make a list

469
00:16:35,460 --> 00:16:38,580
把生下宝宝后立马就会冲你大吼的
of all the things that I am going to scream at you

470
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:41,451
所有事儿都写下来
as soon as this baby's out of me.

471
00:16:43,980 --> 00:16:46,020
我没想到她会攒着到将来报复
I didn't think it all the way through.

472
00:16:49,580 --> 00:16:50,740
你好 米奇
Oh, hello, Mitch.

473
00:16:50,971 --> 00:16:53,020
你居然给克莱尔买花
Uh, you got Claire flowers?

474
00:16:53,020 --> 00:16:54,320
嗯 昨晚够难熬的
Yes. I had a little bit of a rough night.

475
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:55,360
我何尝不是
Yeah, you and me both.

476
00:16:55,980 --> 00:16:58,220
爸爸昨天睡我屋来着
Daddy slept in my room last night.

477
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,640
-分给我点儿 -搞什么 不行
- Here, give me some of those. - What? No.

478
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:01,565
-都是你害我的 -别拽了 弄坏了
- You got me into this. - Hey, stop! You're breaking them!

479
00:17:01,565 --> 00:17:02,680
我不能空着手见小卡
I need--I'm not going to Cam empty-handed!

480
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:06,920
菲尔 快松手
Phil, let go of the...

481
00:17:10,715 --> 00:17:11,475
稳住
Hold still!

482
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:14,820
这全是克莱尔与小卡的功劳吗
Claire and Cam did all this?

483
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:17,500
一周前 这里还是一片废墟
A week ago, that was all junk.

484
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:19,440
太不可思议了
It's amazing.

485
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:20,900
中间有些不平坦
I mean, there's that little bump in the middle.

486
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:22,140
但除此之外...
But other than that...

487
00:17:22,140 --> 00:17:24,220
就算哪个小家伙打出了五个全垒打
Even if one of those boys had hit five home runs,

488
00:17:24,340 --> 00:17:25,860
赛场上最耀眼的明星依然是克莱尔
the biggest star on that field was Claire.

489
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:27,880
这就是婚姻的可笑之处
That's the funny thing about marriage.

490
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,580
你爱上了一个
You fall in love with this...

491
00:17:29,580 --> 00:17:30,740
卓越优秀的人
extraordinary person,

492
00:17:30,740 --> 00:17:32,760
但随着时间推移 却只能看到对方的平凡
And over time, they begin to seem ordinary.

493
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,640
我觉得是她太唠叨的缘故
I think it's all the nagging.

494
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,400
哇 这真是
Wow. This...

495
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:43,360
这真是太不可思议了
This is incredible.

496
00:17:43,460 --> 00:17:45,260
你真是有一双识钻石的慧眼
You literally saw a diamond in the rough.

497
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:48,360
是 我承担了很多没人愿意承担的项目
Yeah, but I take on a lot of projects no one else is willing to.

498
00:17:49,360 --> 00:17:49,880
是我活该
I deserve that.

499
00:17:50,460 --> 00:17:51,760
我是个白痴居然质疑你的能力
I was an idiot for doubting you.

500
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,700
亲爱的 求你原谅我
Please, honey, forgive me.

501
00:17:54,100 --> 00:17:54,760
看在你送我
How could I not,

502
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:56,980
这束烂花的份上 我怎能不原谅
when you give me this bouquet of crumpled flowers?

503
00:17:57,080 --> 00:17:58,700
-都怪米奇尔 -又赖他吗
- Mitchell did that! - Mitchell again?

504
00:17:58,860 --> 00:17:59,560
不信问莉莉啊
Ask Lily!

505
00:18:00,660 --> 00:18:02,080
-小卡 -来啦
- Hey, Cam. - Hey.

506
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,814
给你 拿着
Here you--Okay. Well...

507
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,700
哇 支离破碎
Oh, wow. Broken and mangled...

508
00:18:05,820 --> 00:18:07,040
和人家的小心脏一样
Just like my heart.

509
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:09,720
小卡 对不起我没有支持你
Cam, I'm sorry for not supporting you.

510
00:18:10,060 --> 00:18:11,900
-那毛衣呢 -不可原谅
- What about the sweater? - That's unforgivable.

511
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:14,000
你花费了那么多心思和时间
I mean, you put all that time and work into it,

512
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:14,340
我就那样从车窗扔出去了
and I just toss it out the car window.

513
00:18:14,340 --> 00:18:15,240
从车窗扔出去了
Tossed it out the car window?!

514
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:17,620
不小心坦白过头了
I'm forgetting how much you knew.

515
00:18:17,940 --> 00:18:20,200
知道吗 伙计们 说实话
You know what, guys? Honestly, I...

516
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:22,240
我觉得我们应该行动 投资那栋房子
I think we should do it. I think we should go for the house.

517
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,660
-真的吗 -谨慎些 亲爱的
- Really? - Okay, but careful, honey.

518
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:24,800
不是真心话不要说出来
Don't say something if you don't mean it.

519
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:27,220
我是真心的 我觉得你俩太厉害了
No, I do mean it. I think you two will do a fantastic job.

520
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:28,980
我也这样觉得 我入伙了
You know, I do, too. I'm on board.

521
00:18:29,060 --> 00:18:29,700
入什么伙
On board for what?

522
00:18:29,780 --> 00:18:31,920
我们四个 打算投资房子
Oh, well, the four of us, uh, might go in on a house.

523
00:18:32,040 --> 00:18:33,420
克莱尔和我负责翻新工作
Claire and I fix it up and flip it.

524
00:18:33,420 --> 00:18:35,440
那是我听过的最糟糕的主意
That's the worst idea I ever heard.

525
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,980
你们对建筑一窍不通
You guys know nothing about construction.

526
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:39,720
你们会犯下各种错误
You'll make all sorts of mistakes,

527
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:42,360
你们会反目 不再理会对方
you'll turn on each other, you'll stop talking,

528
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:45,240
突然间 周末聚餐由一次变成两次
and suddenly I'm doing two dinners a week instead of one

529
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:47,120
因为你们无法共处一室
because you can't be in the same room.

530
00:18:47,540 --> 00:18:49,080
家人与生意不能搅在一起
Family and business doesn't mix.

531
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:51,171
你们总归是爱干嘛干嘛 我操个什么心
Ah, you're gonna do whatever you want. Why do I bother?

532
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:53,220
他说的对吗
Is he right?

533
00:18:53,220 --> 00:18:55,728
你知道爸这个人 他是个悲观主义者
Y-you know dad. I mean, he's a pessimist.

534
00:18:55,820 --> 00:18:57,340
我想我们能买下那房子
I want us to get that house.

535
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:59,060
真的 但我不想大家吵架
I do. But I don't want us to fight.

536
00:18:59,220 --> 00:19:00,280
我们不会吵架的
We're not gonna fight.

537
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:01,180
当然不会了
Of course not.

538
00:19:01,180 --> 00:19:01,840
可能吧
Probably.

539
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:03,480
不知道 我们会吵吗
I don't know. Will we?

540
00:19:04,940 --> 00:19:07,140
也许我们可以先缓缓 好好考虑下
Maybe we just take a beat and think about it.

541
00:19:07,140 --> 00:19:08,948
是 这样也没坏处
Yeah. I-I guess that couldn't hurt.

542
00:19:08,960 --> 00:19:09,300
是的
Yeah.

543
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:10,940
你们是我们的至亲
You guys mean the world to us.

544
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:12,700
我可不想因为一栋房子和你们闹翻
I don't want to jeopardize that over a house.

545
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:16,500
-我们也这样觉得 -我知道
- We feel the same way. - I know.

546
00:19:17,201 --> 00:19:18,745
-我只想说我知道我们会做得很好 -喂
- I just wanna say I know we'd do a good job, though. - Hello?

547
00:19:18,838 --> 00:19:20,233
-我觉得 -布鲁克太太 卖房子那位
- And I feel so-- - It's Mrs. Brooks, the lady with the house.

548
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,600
您能来电真是太好了
Actually, it's good that you called.

549
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:23,640
什么
What?

550
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:24,760
什么事
What happened?

551
00:19:25,056 --> 00:19:26,866
吉尔·索普刚刚给她出价了
Gil Thorpe just made her an offer.

552
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:30,660
-我们买了 -我们买了一栋房子
- We did it! - We bought a house.

553
00:19:30,660 --> 00:19:31,680
肯定会非常棒
It's gonna be... great!

554
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:33,500
会出错吗 不可能
What could go wrong? Nothing.

555
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:38,240
有时候我不太理解人类
Sometimes I don't understand people.

556
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:41,080
他们因为最傻的原因做出疯狂的事
They do crazy things for the dumbest reasons.

557
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:43,800
我会上场 尽全力击球
I'm going to march out there and swing as hard as I can.

558
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:45,680
如果那些体育电影拍的是真的
And if every sports movie is correct,

559
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:47,220
我会奋力击中球
I'm going to smack that ball,

560
00:19:47,220 --> 00:19:49,580
我跑上垒时大家会高呼我的名字
and everyone will chant my name as I round the bases.

561
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:50,780
顺便问下
By the way,

562
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,160
总是逆时针方向跑 还是我可以自己选
it is always counterclockwise, or do I get to choose?

563
00:19:53,320 --> 00:19:54,720
怎样都没关系啦
I don't think it's gonna matter.

564
00:19:54,861 --> 00:19:57,858
他们说服自己无论怎样都会有好结果
They convince themselves it'll all work out...

565
00:19:57,940 --> 00:19:59,780
请各位起立唱国歌
Please rise for the national anthem.

566
00:20:01,940 --> 00:20:03,360
我要让你知道谁唱得好
I'm gonna show you who can sing.

567
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:04,389
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

568
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:05,900
真是一场灾难
Oh, this is gonna be rough.

569
00:20:05,900 --> 00:20:09,180
他们会无视所有相反的证据
Despite all the evidence to the contrary.

570
00:20:09,981 --> 00:20:14,155
啊 你可看见
Oh say can you see?

571
00:20:14,155 --> 00:20:18,080
透过一线曙光
By the dawn's early light?

572
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:19,940
我想也不算太差吧
Which I guess isn't so bad.

573
00:20:19,999 --> 00:20:26,320
火炮闪闪发光
And the rocket's red glare!

574
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:27,820
我只想说
All I'm saying is,

575
00:20:27,820 --> 00:20:30,000
上帝保佑你的歌声不要遗传你妈
I hope to god you don't have your mother's singing voice.

576
00:20:30,660 --> 00:20:32,840
但是老天 我希望你遗传到她的自信
But, man, I hope you get her self-confidence.

577
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:37,940
快睡吧
Try to get some sleep.

578
00:20:38,120 --> 00:20:38,980
我们明早再聊
I'll talk to you in the morning.

579
00:20:44,779 --> 00:20:48,957
二人出局 第六局下半 四分平手
2 outs, bottom of the sixth. Tied at 4.

580
00:20:49,420 --> 00:20:50,300
重要时刻来了 伙计们
This is it, folks.

581
00:20:50,460 --> 00:20:52,360
成败在此一击
The whole game comes down to this.

582
00:20:52,589 --> 00:20:54,950
曼尼·迪尔加多 三击全不中
Manny Delgado 0 for 3 on the day.

583
00:20:55,060 --> 00:20:56,060
歌洛莉亚 你怎么看
Gloria, your thoughts?

584
00:20:56,300 --> 00:20:58,140
我认为他会击出全垒打
I think he's going to hit the home run.

585
00:20:59,220 --> 00:21:00,460
求你了 上帝保佑
Please, god, give me one.

586
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:02,760
曼尼 站直了
Manny, stand up straight!

587
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:03,971
膝盖弯曲
But bend your knees.

588
00:21:03,971 --> 00:21:05,313
马步扎稳了
Widen your stance!

589
00:21:05,313 --> 00:21:06,777
拜托你们让我...
Would you please let me just--

590
00:21:07,251 --> 00:21:07,927
快跑垒
Take your base!

591
00:21:07,937 --> 00:21:10,712
-你成功了 曼尼 -我成功了吗
- You did it! You got it, Manny! - I did it?

592
00:21:10,712 --> 00:21:12,660
错了 不是那边 跑这边
No, no, no, no! Not that way! Go this way!

593
00:21:12,660 --> 00:21:14,580
我操个什么心 反正他爱干嘛就会干嘛
Oh, why do I bother? He's gonna do what he wants.

594
00:21:15,310 --> 00:21:19,960
曼尼 曼尼 曼尼
Manny! Manny! Manny!
